WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.335
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.335
Now, if you don't mind,

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:04.837
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:07.140
Eric Trump took
the witness stand today

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:11.310
in the Trump Organization's
$250 million civil fraud trial.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.681
Though, does anyone believe they
told Eric what was going on?

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:15.848
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:17.250
What's he going
to testify about?

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.186
The magazines
and the outer office?

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:23.089
"Yeah, there was
a 'Car and Driver' from 2009

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:25.991
and some 'Golf Digests,'
I think."

00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:28.227
Donald Trump Jr.
took the witness stand yesterday

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:29.996
in Manhattan Supreme Court
and testified

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.298
about his various
duties and responsibilities

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:33.766
at the Trump Organization.

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:36.202
His job was to let
his dad slap him

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.037
whenever Eric wasn't around.

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:40.039
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:43.042
The Texas Rangers defeated
the Arizona Diamondbacks

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:44.643
last night to win
the World Series,

00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:46.713
which came as a shock
to Mets fans

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.648
who thought baseball
ended in August.

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:51.350
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.052
Fox News host Sean Hannity

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:55.388
had a live show last night
from the Capitol.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.924
Said his viewers,
"Hey, I've been there!"

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:00.827
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:04.029
According to an analysis of his
personal financial disclosures,

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:07.466
House speaker Mike Johnson
does not have a bank account.

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:09.902
He keeps trying to open one,
but no one at the bank

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:12.771
will believe his name
is Mike Johnson.

00:01:12.771 --> 00:01:14.140
"It's really my name,

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:18.011
and I really live
123 Main Street!"

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.712
That's right.
House speaker Mike Johnson's

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.414
personal financial disclosures

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.750
show no investments,
bank account or assets.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:27.019
Though, in his defense,
that's probably the only reason

00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:29.789
why George Santos hasn't
stolen his identity yet.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.091
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.227
80-year-old Congresswoman
Kay Granger

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:36.663
announced yesterday that
she will not seek reelection

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:38.964
because at that age,
it's time to kick back

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:40.233
and run for president.

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:44.770
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.172
It was announced yesterday

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:49.141
that the 2023 Rockefeller Center
Christmas tree

00:01:49.141 --> 00:01:50.910
will be an 80-foot-tall,

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.645
12-ton Norway spruce
from Vestal, New York,

00:01:53.645 --> 00:01:56.715
continuing the long tradition
of coming from upstate

00:01:56.715 --> 00:01:58.151
to get in everybody's way.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:01.120
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:04.157
Celebrity chef Guy Fieri's
line of malt beverages,

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.391
Flavortown Spiked,
recently unveiled

00:02:06.391 --> 00:02:08.160
a new fruit punch flavor.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:11.264
"Flavortown Spiked" is also
what he asked for at Supercuts.

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:15.201
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.436
In the end, that had nothing
to do with the fact

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:19.239
they have
a new fruit punch flavor.

00:02:21.573 --> 00:02:24.577
We need to write jokes
about the news that happened.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.979
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.979 --> 00:02:28.214
According to a new survey,

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:31.284
88% of doctors said
it was likely

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:33.452
that patients would receive
some misinformation

00:02:33.452 --> 00:02:36.388
when asking AI chat bots
for medical information,

00:02:36.388 --> 00:02:38.625
like this guy who's
going through menopause.

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:41.327
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:43.562
Starbucks unveiled
its holiday menu yesterday,

00:02:43.562 --> 00:02:47.099
which includes a new
iced gingerbread oatmilk chai,

00:02:47.099 --> 00:02:49.835
which is great if you're looking
for something both seasonal

00:02:49.835 --> 00:02:52.005
and humiliating
to say out loud.

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:55.007
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.007 --> 00:02:57.710
"I'll just take that new --
the new one.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.312
The -- The new one over there."

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:01.181
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:03.049
According to a new study,
men who picked up

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:05.084
their cellphones
more than 20 times a day

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:07.720
have 21%
lower sperm concentration.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.588
Which begs the question:

00:03:09.588 --> 00:03:11.457
what are they picking it up
with?

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:15.561
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.561 --> 00:03:18.197
Hold on. I just got a text.

00:03:18.197 --> 00:03:22.735
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:24.737
Wasn't important.

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:27.273
And finally, the footwear
company Crocs has partnered

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.842
with McDonald's
to release a new line of shoes.

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:32.511
So now you can show people
you've given up twice.

00:03:32.511 --> 00:03:35.748
And that -- that was
a monologue, everybody.

